{"3428410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Langit Lupa: Office Wars", "steam_appid": 3428410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/b153e6579bf8ccaf867ea59faec337e1.poster.avif?t=1780461355\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/b153e6579bf8ccaf867ea59faec337e1.webm?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/b153e6579bf8ccaf867ea59faec337e1.mp4?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Langit Lupa: Fast-paced multiplayer chase game set in an office environment, inspired by a classic Filipino childhood game, where you leap across desks and chairs to avoid the floor and outmaneuver your coworkers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/4c00af404ca8fa2f5a062609c796f09b.poster.avif?t=1780461355\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/4c00af404ca8fa2f5a062609c796f09b.webm?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/4c00af404ca8fa2f5a062609c796f09b.mp4?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Desks, chairs, and random office supplies have never been so fun to climb, throw, or dodge. Who knew staplers could be so dangerous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/02bf7f4851d4b4d4da4382a7b2df747f.poster.avif?t=1780461355\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/02bf7f4851d4b4d4da4382a7b2df747f.webm?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/02bf7f4851d4b4d4da4382a7b2df747f.mp4?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 Grab your buddies, open a private lobby, and get your betrayal game on. Punch or hurl random objects at your pals—even if they’re not the tagger—because who needs trust when you can have utter pandemonium?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/289d59aff5e75be302d29f27f2af4515.poster.avif?t=1780461355\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/289d59aff5e75be302d29f27f2af4515.webm?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/289d59aff5e75be302d29f27f2af4515.mp4?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls. No mouse required for this one—just use WASD to move and J to tag. Everything else is optional.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Gameplay Objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 Game Modes (Langit Lupa, 21, Ice-ice Water, Agawan Base, Labo-labo, Capture the Flag, Pass the Bomb, Lipat Bayan, Claygo, Sungka, Patintero, Tumba Lata, Palosebo, Luksong Baka, Hide and Seek, Chinese Garter, Jumping Rope)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 to 10 players</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/b153e6579bf8ccaf867ea59faec337e1.poster.avif?t=1780461355\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/b153e6579bf8ccaf867ea59faec337e1.webm?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/b153e6579bf8ccaf867ea59faec337e1.mp4?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Langit Lupa: Fast-paced multiplayer chase game set in an office environment, inspired by a classic Filipino childhood game, where you leap across desks and chairs to avoid the floor and outmaneuver your coworkers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/4c00af404ca8fa2f5a062609c796f09b.poster.avif?t=1780461355\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/4c00af404ca8fa2f5a062609c796f09b.webm?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/4c00af404ca8fa2f5a062609c796f09b.mp4?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Desks, chairs, and random office supplies have never been so fun to climb, throw, or dodge. Who knew staplers could be so dangerous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/02bf7f4851d4b4d4da4382a7b2df747f.poster.avif?t=1780461355\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/02bf7f4851d4b4d4da4382a7b2df747f.webm?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/02bf7f4851d4b4d4da4382a7b2df747f.mp4?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 Grab your buddies, open a private lobby, and get your betrayal game on. Punch or hurl random objects at your pals—even if they’re not the tagger—because who needs trust when you can have utter pandemonium?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/289d59aff5e75be302d29f27f2af4515.poster.avif?t=1780461355\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/289d59aff5e75be302d29f27f2af4515.webm?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/289d59aff5e75be302d29f27f2af4515.mp4?t=1780461355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls. No mouse required for this one—just use WASD to move and J to tag. Everything else is optional.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Gameplay Objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 Game Modes (Langit Lupa, 21, Ice-ice Water, Agawan Base, Labo-labo, Capture the Flag, Pass the Bomb, Lipat Bayan, Claygo, Sungka, Patintero, Tumba Lata, Palosebo, Luksong Baka, Hide and Seek, Chinese Garter, Jumping Rope)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 to 10 players</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A fast-paced MULTIPLAYER PARTY game of TAG set in an office, where you leap across desks, THROW STUFF, and PUSH COWORKERS. With over 20+ classic Filipino childhood games, this game is as FUNNY as it gets—perfect to PLAY WITH FRIENDS!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/f3a1e54402cf265c76b48d98afd7a2ae35b7c0c4/header.jpg?t=1780461355", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/57fb023e12ebaef1f6f3d33db386618f71adb35c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780461355", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/57fb023e12ebaef1f6f3d33db386618f71adb35c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780461355", "website": "https://www.ninetysix-studios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.0 (Monterey) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 (Apple Silicon)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple